\\frac{2x}{y-{x}^{2}}\\right)j\n$$ over the domain $D=\\{(x,y)\\in {\\mathbb{R}}^{2}\\hspace{0.222em}:\\hspace{0.222em}y>{x}^{2}\\}.$"] [17592186490290 "For the transformation $\\mathbf{T},$ defined as\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{T}(\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix})⟶\\begin{bmatrix}uv \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n  \n\ncompute the value of the Jacobian determinant at the point where $\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.$"] [17592186490314 "Which of the following vector fields have a stream function?\n\nI. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=\\operatorname{cos}x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-x\\operatorname{cos}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nIII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+2{e}^{y}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$"] [17592186490318 "Which of the following vector fields have a stream function?\n\nI. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)={x}^{2}\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-xy\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=({x}^{2}-2xy)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+({y}^{2}-2xy)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nIII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)={e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}(3y)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}(3y)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$"] [17592186499455 "Which of the following vector fields have a stream function?\n\nI. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=\\operatorname{sinh}x\\operatorname{cos}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-\\operatorname{cosh}x\\operatorname{sin}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=x\\operatorname{cos}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+y\\operatorname{sin}x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$\n\nIII. $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=({x}^{2}+4y)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-(2{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+y)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$"] [17592186499504 "Which of the following is a stream function for the vector field\n$\\mathbf{F}(x,y)={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}y\\hspace{0.167